<html><head><title>Synthetic boundary record: history-05</title></head><body><article><p>The Aster Valve service manual requires three steps: isolate the supply, inspect the seal, and reconnect the supply. These are its listed service steps. This is a synthetic evaluation record about fictional participants and places. Only the statements in this record are available as evidence. No additional identity, dates, measurements or relationships are implied. The record is deliberately limited in scope; omitted details cannot be recovered from it. </p></article></body></html>